    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, if the goal was actually \"defensive\", why do they keep pushing into regions that have clear security ties to russia? it feels like they're just ignoring the obvious reality that this is an expansionist policy. isn't it more accurate to say that the \"democratic values\" argument is just a way to justify breaking long-standing geopolitical balances?",
